{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"```systemverilog\nmodule edge_detector (\n    input  wire clk,\n    input  wire rst,\n    input  wire din,\n    output reg  pulse\n);\n\n    reg din_history;\n\n    always_ff @(posedge clk) begin\n        if (rst) begin\n            din_history <= 1'b0;\n            pulse       <= 1'b0;\n        end else begin\n            pulse       <= din & ~din_history;\n            din_history <= din;\n        end\n    end\n\nendmodule\n```"}}
